## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW & OBJECTIVE

The objective of this engagement is to engineer, deploy, and scale an automated real estate intelligence platform that provides prospective property buyers, homeowners, developers, and investors with immediate, location-accurate financial estimates for both **existing properties** and **new construction projects from scratch**.

The platform is engineered as a high-utility tri-platform ecosystem:
1. **Native Mobile App (React Native for iOS & Android):** A fluid, responsive mobile application published on the **Apple App Store** and **Google Play Store**, allowing real estate buyers, investors, and field agents to calculate property valuations and building costs on the go.
2. **Central Operations Web Dashboard (Next.js):** A desktop-optimized web control panel for real estate executives and administrators to configure regional land/building rates, adjust construction material pricing indexes, and manage inbound leads.

The platform functions as both a self-service valuation calculator for users and an automated client-acquisition engine for the business, capturing verified contact details (WhatsApp-enabled phone numbers and emails) before unlocking complete financial reports.

